{"id":1831,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>\r各位保健干部：\r</p><p>\r为方便我校未参检的保健干部顺利完成年度健康体检，经与山西省人民医院和平院区沟通协调，现决定我校还未参检的保健干部可于2026年7月20日（下周一）和7月21日（下周二）进行集中体检。\r</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4vSbUzGsLmLsnzllZolr7MlQ7MRrlVLzWRollZL4-DLz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyPU1yin1yaL4-8nlCDLN7sUNnfU4GiUzfVnRVRM7C8LmnFL4rkMzl8UzMFLmvDL87Jv2bjo4OeosX1QdAFLmGPokhXptQ0g47aLzU0MzN8MRLJqdrnx&oid=1472165184&tid=1014&nid=59443&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/91B5F0324EF62A7BDAC05A0ED1C4F424/35B554A3/2763A?e=.png\" vheight=\"513\" vwidth=\"450\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4vSbUzGsLmLsnzllZolr7MlQ7MRrlVLzWRollZL4-DLz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyPU1yin1yaL4-8nlCDLN7sUNnfU4GiUzfVnRVRM7C8LmnFL4rkMzl8UzMFLmvDL87Jv2bjo4OeosX1QdAFLmGPokhXptQ0g47aLzU0MzN8MRLJqdrnx&oid=1472165184&tid=1014&nid=59443&e=.png\"></p><p>\r参检人员可通过扫码预约\r</p><p></p><p></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"https://www.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4vSbUzGsLmLsnzllZolr7MlQ7MRrlVLzWRollZL4-DLz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyPU1yin1yaL4-8nlCDLN7sUNnfU4GiUzfVnRVRM7C8LmnFL4rkMzl8UzMFLmvDL87Jv2bjo4OeosX1QdAFLmGPokhXptQ0g47aLzU0MzN8MRLJqdrnx&oid=1472165184&tid=1014&nid=59443&e=.png"}